'' A static dynamic array with written bounds is sized ONCE: 'static a( l to u )' over variables
'' was never sized, and 'redim a( 1 to 2 ) as integer' in a 'sub ... static' re-ran on every call,
'' undoing a later REDIM (dim/static.bas).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/static-dynarray-sized-once.bas -o tests/codegen/staticdynarraysizedonce.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/staticdynarraysizedonce.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5              6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1             1             2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2             3             4
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3             3             4
